<ul>
  <li>
    Built and annotated a multi-speaker dataset of ≈48,000 clips (15 h) from 50 <em>Genshin Impact</em> characters, using ECAPA-TDNN for speaker
    classification and Whisper for transcription
  </li>
  <li>Fine-tuned a VITS speech synthesis model on a curated set of Paimon clips</li>
  <li>
    Released it as a technical demo on Bilibili (600K+ views) with a public
    <a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1HDV84t3N-yUEBXN8dDIDSv6CzEJykCLw" target="_blank">Colab</a> for anyone to try
